      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The better way to do this would be to use the physbone isGrabbed bool to trigger an animation to lock the object to your hand with a parent constraint.  Same outcome, seamless to onlookers, and less physics involved.\nOr even a combination of IsGrabbed and Stretch to detect if you've, say, grabbed AND pulled a weapon from its holster.",
