      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5e89d0822aedbc56a3155d12|full_name}: I was thinking of using it to make an arsenal appear and have other players hold and use it.\nCurrently, it is not possible to \"constraint target > other users' hands\", and I think mentioned as one of the features we would like to have.",
